# REQUIREMENTS: cu-003
# TIMESTAMP: 2026-10-09

The writer emits one subdirectory per regular CU holding its four component
files and NO per-CU .itr blob for component-carrying CUs (component-less
legacy CUs keep one <cu-id>.itr inside their folder, never at root);
keeps ARCH.itr/LEGEND.itr and other globals at the ITR root; writes root
SYNOPSIS.itr (features, MAX_ATTEMPTS, implementation summary); keeps
IMPLEMENTATION_STEPS.itr gitignored.
